  "description": "Bank of America is struggling. This regional bank is showing me something very different...",
  "body_html": "<p>Bank of America has been in the news lately… too often. After a -11% sell off, its common I get questioned about whether a big name stock like this is a buy. In my opinion…no. </p><p>Besides the fact that we <em><strong>DO NOT FIGHT TRENDS</strong></em>… at a very minimum I would need to see some strength locally in the price action. Remember, we do not need to get the “bottom” or “best price.” We simply need to see some strength return. </p><p>Additionally, I prefer positive headlines. Not that I put much weight into mainstream headlines… but we want every variable that influences stock price, to be on our side. When I see headlines like:</p><ul><li><p>Bank of America’s Unrealized Bond Losses Could Top $90 BILLION<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-1\" href=\"#footnote-1\" target=\"_self\">1</a></p></li><li><p>Bank of America doubling AI Budget<a class=\"footnote-anchor\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteAnchorToDOM\" id=\"footnote-anchor-2\" href=\"#footnote-2\" target=\"_self\">2</a></p></li></ul><p>And when they are pushing tickers like Everpure, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$P&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>, in mainstream media, that has also locally broke trend… giving price targets of $150…yet reducing its position size</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div class=\"image-link image2\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FkqL!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F51800aee-236e-4b0b-b197-186eb2945727_1206x180.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FkqL!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F51800aee-236e-4b0b-b197-186eb2945727_1206x180.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FkqL!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F51800aee-236e-4b0b-b197-186eb2945727_1206x180.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FkqL!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F51800aee-236e-4b0b-b197-186eb2945727_1206x180.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FkqL!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F51800aee-236e-4b0b-b197-186eb2945727_1206x180.jpeg\" width=\"1206\" height=\"180\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/51800aee-236e-4b0b-b197-186eb2945727_1206x180.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:180,&quot;width&quot;:1206,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:43670,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/216299496?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb22a16d2-3ae9-4c09-b121-45fa295026ca_1206x2451.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FkqL!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F51800aee-236e-4b0b-b197-186eb2945727_1206x180.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!FkqL!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%