-container\"><figure><div class=\"image-link image2\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!h6es!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9067166e-c96a-4113-91ec-a2392483e998_597x61.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!h6es!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9067166e-c96a-4113-91ec-a2392483e998_597x61.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!h6es!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9067166e-c96a-4113-91ec-a2392483e998_597x61.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!h6es!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9067166e-c96a-4113-91ec-a2392483e998_597x61.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!h6es!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9067166e-c96a-4113-91ec-a2392483e998_597x61.png\" width=\"597\" height=\"61\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/9067166e-c96a-4113-91ec-a2392483e998_597x61.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:61,&quot;width&quot;:597,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:16466,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/216299496?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9067166e-c96a-4113-91ec-a2392483e998_597x61.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!h6es!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9067166e-c96a-4113-91ec-a2392483e998_597x61.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!h6es!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9067166e-c96a-4113-91ec-a2392483e998_597x61.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!h6es!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9067166e-c96a-4113-91ec-a2392483e998_597x61.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!h6es!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F9067166e-c96a-4113-91ec-a2392483e998_597x61.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"></picture><div></div></div></div><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">But has been noted to be downsizing their holdings…</figcaption></figure></div><p>I don’t have much confidence in a stock like Bank of America, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$BAC&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>. Of course, anything could happen, but these are not the variables I seek for high performance stocks. </p><h4>Avoid Large Banks. Regional Banks However… </h4><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p>We have been pushing regional banks since the beginning of 2026, in which they make up a heavy proportion of the <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/only-10-stocks-made-the-cut?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok ETF</a>, which has doubled and sometimes tripled the performance of the S&amp;P 500. Regional Banks were also included in the <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-etf-20?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok ETF 2.0</a>,</strong> which was built July 28th, and remains relevant today. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-ihP!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F81a0ff49-b2f5-4d5d-b911-0327978d5dbe_868x786.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-ihP!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F81a0ff49-b2f5-4d5d-b911-0327978d5dbe_868x786.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-ihP!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F81a0ff49-b2f5-4d5d-b911-0327978d5dbe_868x786.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-ihP!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F81a0ff49-b2f5-4d5d-b911-0327978d5dbe_868x786.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-ihP!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F81a0ff49-b2f5-4d5d-b911-0327978d5dbe_868x786.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-ihP!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F81a0ff49-b2f5-4d5d-b911-0327978d5dbe_868x786.png\" width=\"868\" height=\"786\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/81a0ff49-b2f5-4d5d-b911-0327978d5dbe_868x786.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:786,&quot;width&quot;:868,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:87535,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/216299496?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F81a0ff49-b2f5-4d5d-b911-0327978d5dbe_868x786.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-ihP!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F81a0ff49-b2f5-4d5d-b911-0327978d5dbe_868x786.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-ihP!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F81a0ff49-b2f5-4d5d-b911-0327978d5dbe_868x786.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-ihP!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F81a0ff49-b2f5-4d5d-b911-0327978d5dbe_868x786.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!-ihP!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F81a0ff49-b2f5-4d5d-b911-0327978d5dbe_868x786.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">StockTok ETF continues to double the S&amp;P 500 performance. Market has largely been stagnant the last ~2 months, I still expect more growth for our basket of stocks.</figcaption></figure></div><p>Additionally, I mentioned in the video, when I reviewed <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/i-found-3-stocks-hiding-among-389?r=4z8lgl\">Reviewed 389 different IPO stocks from the last 2-3 years</a>, </strong>the #2 stock was yet again, a regional bank. NB Bancorp, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$NBBK&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span>, continues to oscillate in a bullish formation. While banks like Bank of America are experience revenue and EPS stagnation or little growth, regional banks like NBBK are experiencing huge growth. Not to mention, only  .26% of the shares are closely held by BAC, compared to NBBK at 12.5% for 40M shares. </p><h4>Way better odds of profitability with the regional banks. </h4><div><hr></div><p>Today I am predominantly seeking how the market is towards market close. I never really care about the majority of a Friday… but a green Friday close increases the odds that we have a green next week. This will determine whether we continue adding to our winning positions, or pause. Updates to follow. </p><p>Swing by the main chat if you have any questions or want to talk more. I will be available most of the day during market hours. Otherwise, have a great weekend!</p><h4>Be sure to like ❤️ and re-stack 🔄 this post!  </h4><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!W3S9!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8add7fc9-8edc-4748-ba33-360428e75ee1_1206x1206.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div><p></p><div class=\"footnote\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteToDOM\"><a id=\"footnote-1\" href=\"#footnote-anchor-1\" class=\"footnote-number\" contenteditable=\"false\" target=\"_self\">1</a><div class=\"footnote-content\"><p>https://www.barrons.com/articles/bank-of-america-stock-bond-losses-edae54c9</p></div></div><div class=\"footnote\" data-component-name=\"FootnoteToDOM\"><a id=\"footnote-2\" href=\"#footnote-anchor-2\" class=\"footnote-number\" contenteditable=\"false\" target=\"_self\">2</a><div class=\"footnote-content\"><p>https://www.efinancialcareers.com/news/bank-of-america-is-only-replacing-75-of-employees-who-leave</p></div></div>",
